## Phase Completion

Spawn reviewer to verify:
- [ ] PLAN.md committed before execution began
- [ ] Complete all PLAN.md tasks
- [ ] Per-segment `SUMMARY-XX.Y.md` files exist for each segment
- [ ] Watchdog ran (`WATCHDOG-XX.Y.md`); any product bugs it flagged were fixed
- [ ] Pass all configured verification commands
- [ ] Escapes logged in `ESCAPES.md` if any post-review fixes were needed
- [ ] Reviewer marked `APPROVED`, THEN commit with: `feat(XX-YY): summary`
- [ ] Create phase `SUMMARY.md`
- [ ] Update ROADMAP.md and run the phase retrospective
